OL,3,GNEWSAANPR cameras put up to stop bad
OL,4,Aschool parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAutomatic Numberplate Recognition
OL,7,FCameras (ANPR) have been put up near
OL,8,Fsome schools in a bid to encourage
OL,9,Fsafer parking.
OL,11,FThe cameras, being deployed in
OL,12,FWiltshire, could lead to some drivers
OL,13,Fbeing fined if they stop in the wrong
OL,14,Fplaces at the start and end of the
OL,15,Fschool day.
OL,17,FParents at school-pick up at Queen's
OL,18,FCrescent Primary in Chippenham told the
OL,19,FBBC streets previously could get "quite
OL,20,Fchaotic", but were now "quieter".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
