OL,3,GNEWSAANPR cameras put up to stop bad
OL,4,Aschool parking
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've got 411 families that access the
OL,7,Fschool site," headteacher James Essam
OL,8,Fsaid. "Having a large number of
OL,9,Fvehicles [previously] coming down the
OL,10,Froad, it was very busy. It just wasn't
OL,11,Fsafe for a lot of our families and the
OL,12,Fchildren trying to access the site on
OL,13,Ffoot."
